{"id":23029,"name":"那无数个春天","rarity":5,"path":"Warlock","desc":"虚无命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"几场急雨过后，春潮初涨，碧草丛生。\\n<i>「这是第几个春天了？」 </i>\\n他想起那些初次奔赴战场的年轻战士。年年岁岁，不同的人，却都是一样的朝气蓬勃、充满希望。\\n柳条折尽待君回，最后他们带回故土的…往往是再也无法融化的冰霜。\\n\\n鸟鸣悠然，他闭上双眼，任日光透过树叶缝隙扑于脸上。\\n——<i>「所以啊，还是留下来的人最寂寞。」 </i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23029,"name":"世事无痕","desc":"使装备者的效果命中提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，装备者施放普攻、战技、终结技攻击敌方目标后，有<unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak>的基础概率使其陷入【卸甲】状态。【卸甲】状态下，敌方目标受到的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>回合。若目标处于装备者施加的持续伤害状态，则有<unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak>的基础概率将装备者施加的【卸甲】状态升级成【穷寇】状态，使敌方目标受到的伤害额外提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#6[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>回合，期间装备者无法对其施加【卸甲】。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.6,0.6,0.1,2,0.6,0.14]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.7,0.6,0.12,2,0.6,0.16]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.8,0.6,0.14,2,0.6,0.18]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.9,0.6,0.16,2,0.6,0.2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[1,0.6,0.18,2,0.6,0.22]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110221,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110222,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110222,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"d